{"id": "62967", "title": "女妖", "author": "丁五", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 33, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/62/62967.htm", "intro": "孪生兄妹血亲成婚共掌权势，数百年同床异梦最终彻底决裂。双生姐妹持剑相向，胜利者能赢得一切，失败者只得到一口棺材！\r\n当死去的姐姐从棺材里复活，她会对这个混乱而又疯狂的家族有什么影响？\r\n阴谋在九千年前开始了。\r\n人、妖的力量可以和神、魔对抗吗？\r\n穿越而来的她能改变古老家族既定的命运吗？\r\n她，在这个陌生的世界，又将走向怎样的道路？\r\n家斗，情斗，权斗，血斗，斗得天昏地暗，神陨魔灭！", "base": "files/article/html/62/62967", "chapters": [{"title": "1-6", "file": "9334686.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7-12", "file": "9334688.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13-20", "file": "9334689.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-26", "file": "9334690.html", "available": false}, {"title": "27-32", "file": "9334691.html", "available": false}, {"title": "33-37", "file": "9334693.html", "available": false}, {"title": "38-43", "file": "9334694.html", "available": false}, {"title": "44-47", "file": "9334695.html", "available": false}, {"title": "48-53", "file": "9334696.html", "available": false}, {"title": "54-59", "file": "9334699.html", "available": false}, {"title": "60-65", "file": "9334701.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-71", "file": "9334703.html", "available": false}, {"title": "72-76", "file": "9334706.html", "available": false}, {"title": "77-81", "file": "9334707.html", "available": false}, {"title": "82-86", "file": "9334708.html", "available": false}, {"title": "87-91", "file": "9334710.html", "available": false}, {"title": "92-96", "file": "9334711.html", "available": false}, {"title": "97-102", "file": "9334713.html", "available": false}, {"title": "103-109", "file": "9334716.html", "available": false}, {"title": "110-116", "file": "9334718.html", "available": false}, {"title": "117-123", "file": "9334721.html", "available": false}, {"title": "124-130", "file": "9334725.html", "available": false}, {"title": "131-137", "file": "9334727.html", "available": false}, {"title": "138-142", "file": "9334730.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14